## NFR-004: Accessibility

**Target:** WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance.

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] All screens and interactions meet WCAG 2.1 Level AA.
- [ ] WCAG compliance is tested (not assumed) — `jest-axe` + `toHaveNoViolations()` required in every component test file per EMIS-X platform mandate (A11Y-010).
- [ ] WCAG compliance validated using automated tooling (jest-axe) AND manual testing with assistive technologies (screen reader, keyboard-only navigation) prior to release.
- [ ] WCAG standards are built into the EMIS-X UI design system; all components used must be from `@emisgroup/ui-*` to inherit baseline accessibility compliance (DS-001).

**Notes:**
- Accessibility compliance is a legal obligation under the Public Sector Bodies Accessibility Regulations 2018 and the Equality Act 2010.
- Automated testing catches approximately 30–40% of WCAG issues; manual testing is required to achieve full AA compliance.

