### Responsive Design Breakpoints (EMIS Standard — Document Manager)

| Breakpoint | Width | Layout behaviour |
|------------|-------|-----------------|
| Mobile | 320px–767px | Single column queue list; full workflow available — Protocol Panel opens as a full-width overlay covering the document viewer (100vw × 100%, fixed position, scrollable within panel); upload zone available |
| Tablet | 768px–1023px | 2-column; Protocol Panel collapses to bottom sheet; Queue Peek hidden |
| Desktop | 1024px–1440px | Full 3-column gallery (Queue-Peek + Viewer + Protocol Panel); primary target |
| Large Desktop | 1441px+ | Same as Desktop; max-width 1920px; centred content |

> Primary device target: Desktop (GP surgery admin workstation). Mobile = Supported; Protocol Panel rendered as a full-width overlay at <768px — covers the document viewer completely (100vw × 100%, fixed position, scrollable within panel). Full workflow (Match → File → Code → Task) is available on mobile via this overlay pattern.

